Bundled third-party license notices are retained in mermaid.min.js.
The official code-split ES modules are vendored under mermaid-12.3.0/.
They retain upstream license notices and load diagram types on demand.
relay-common-v1.mjs bundles the upstream core, flowchart, sequence, and Dagre
modules with esbuild 0.25.12. Other modules fall back to the original ES modules.
Reproduce with scripts/build_mermaid_common.py; upstream files remain intact.
